Arrows mean "calls or uses". The test file tests every file, therefor
uses each file.

flowchart

    main["main.py<br/>Runs all parts"]
    greedy["greedy.py<br/>Part 1: greedy strategies"]
    brute["brute_force.py<br/>Part 2: all subsets"]
    report["report_output.py<br/>Part 3: printing"]
